- timestamp: "2026-06-15T14:00:00+02:00"
  actor: claude
  action: plan-revision
  summary: >
    Restructured Phase 2 around four differentiating pillars: verified (Kani),
    observable (inference traces), composable (KernelPipeline/DualPipeline),
    deterministic (seeded RNG). Pulled Kani verification from Phase 3 into
    Phase 2. Elevated cuda-oxide GPU kernels to Phase 3 (core product target).
    Deferred continuous batching to Phase 4. Added 18 refined work items across
    2A (foundation), 2B (forward pass), 2C (differentiating API). Research:
    TurboQuant/PQO for verified KV-cache compression (Phase 3), deterministic
    GPU inference via cuda-oxide controlled reduction order, model-internal
    observability as an unclaimed gap in the serving space.

